			"notes": "Updating saving and loading to a much more optimized systems. It is backwards compatible, so your old save data will be converted into the new data through a normal reboot. It is of course recommended to back up the files just in case. There will be a file named `regions.data.delete_when_ready` which you can delete when you're ready. It is the old save data that was left alone to leave a backup.\n\nBug fixes:\n- Players no longer teleport up when the area is regenerating air inside of their block"
		},
