			"notes": "New feature: Block replacement\n\nWhen creating the template for the region, you can now place certain block types that will be replaced during the regeneration process. For example, you may place red_concrete, and then configure the region using `/regenmines modify <region> replacements <block> <table>`. The specified block type will be selected from the provided table.\n\nThe table can be configured in `block tables.yml`. When pasting from the table, it is compatible with the `/setblock` command which means that you can even place chests with loot, suspicious blocks (specified loot overrides the general brushable loot), or signs with text."
		},
